<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CORE cut to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CORE cut to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said Tuesday it had cut its rating for CORE Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Irvine, Calif., management services company were off 3/8 to 8-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
